      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGAL GYPSY (8) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around this track over 350m in 18.92, claiming a Grade 5 by 6 lengths. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. PERCEPTION (1) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten one length (19.20) behind WARREGO RAIN at this track. Overdue and is among the main hopes. BAR NONE (2) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage third, beaten 7 lengths (19.45) at this track in a Grade 5 over 350m. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Leading chance. UNDENIABLE GRIT (7) will be thereabouts after strong recent winning form.",
